# taunt-messages store snapshot
# files at time of writing: 1 (rhetoric)
# dimensions: intensity(hit/miss/critical/fumble) x perspective(toattacker/todefender/toroom)
#
# All three perspectives of one intensity come from ONE coordinated GetTauntTriad call
# (same variant index across the triad). Until 2026-09-09 usercommands/taunt.go called a
# per-perspective getter three times and got three INDEPENDENT indices, so the three
# audiences were narrated three different moments -- the same defect PR #112 fixed for
# melee defence. A fresh SequencePicker per intensity pins index 0.
#
# This snapshot pins index 0 only, so it CANNOT see a regression back to independent
# picks (all three would still read index 0). That is guarded by
# TestGetTauntTriadUsesOneCoordinatedIndex in internal/combat, which shares one
# SequencePicker across the triad so three picks yield 0/1/2 and one pick yields 0/0/0.

rhetoric|hit|toattacker => You sneer at <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi>, and your words cut deep! (<ansi fg="damage">ModerateWounds</ansi>)
rhetoric|hit|todefender => <ansi fg="User">Source</ansi>'s taunt cuts deep, shaking your resolve! (<ansi fg="damage">ModerateWounds</ansi>)
rhetoric|hit|toroom => <ansi fg="User">Source</ansi> sneers at <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi> with contempt!
rhetoric|miss|toattacker => Your taunt falls flat against <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi>.
rhetoric|miss|todefender => <ansi fg="User">Source</ansi> tries to taunt you, but it has no effect.
rhetoric|miss|toroom => <ansi fg="User">Source</ansi> tries to taunt <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi>, but it falls flat.
rhetoric|critical|toattacker => Your words strike like a blade — <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi> recoils in shock! (<ansi fg="damage">ModerateWounds</ansi>) <ansi fg="yellow">[CRIT!]</ansi>
rhetoric|critical|todefender => <ansi fg="User">Source</ansi>'s words cut to the bone — you reel in shock! (<ansi fg="damage">ModerateWounds</ansi>) <ansi fg="yellow">[CRIT!]</ansi>
rhetoric|critical|toroom => <ansi fg="User">Source</ansi>'s words strike like a blade — <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi> recoils!
rhetoric|fumble|toattacker => <ansi fg="red">You stumble over your words trying to taunt <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi> — how embarrassing!</ansi>
rhetoric|fumble|todefender => <ansi fg="green"><ansi fg="User">Source</ansi> tries to taunt you but fumbles their words!</ansi>
rhetoric|fumble|toroom => <ansi fg="User">Source</ansi> stumbles over their words trying to taunt <ansi fg="Mob">Target</ansi>.
